        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique for real estate photos: an interior designer adds 3D furniture and decor to empty or cleared rooms so buyers can see how the space lives, with no furniture ever entering the home. From Loop high-rises to brick two-flats, Bella's designers stage Chicago homes in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo. Ask Beverly — her staged listing drew an offer in four days.",
